<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>

<!--
    Terrathyst: material used for building, stuffables, and some simple weapons
    Prismite: material used for higher tier weapons, armor, and buildings. Can be aquired by charing terrathyst
    Biothite: compressed prismite combined with sunsap. Used for high tier structures, armor, and weapons
    Metajade: jade charged with large amounts of shocksap or starsap. Used as a capacitor for weapons and structures that require high charge.
    Solarite: rare material only found in specific ways. Used to create highest-tier structures and weapons.
    Gravitite: special material found in specific ways. Used to create weapons, structures, and implants that manipulate gravity.-->

<Defs>
